infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title ISR invalidation across pods: shared store vs fan-out
  desc revalidatePath must reach every pod — buy correctness, or buy speed
  compares
    - label Shared cacheHandler
      children
        - label Shared cacheHandler (Redis)
          desc One shared store — correct by construction
        - label +1-3 ms per ISR hit
          desc Redis RTT replaces sub-millisecond pod-local disk
        - label No reconciliation gap
          desc revalidateTag mutates the one store — nothing to monitor
    - label Pub/sub fan-out
      children
        - label Pub/sub fan-out
          desc Keep pod-local caches — sub-millisecond hits
        - label Broadcast invalidation
          desc Webhook publishes; every pod revalidates locally
        - label Reconciliation gap
          desc A pod restarting during publish misses it, never heals
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
